e in  the walking dead word the developer  doesn't really want to give you time to  really look at these options and see  which ones gonna fit for you so what do  they do they give you maybe five to ten  seconds to really choose what you want  sometimes even less than that for the  most part the majority of the game does  have that time structure one but when  you get to these key moments where  they're forcing you to argue with your  person that you're playing this game  with or with multiple people and then  let's say that you don't agree with them  you use that override you get what you  want anyway but you only got a certain  amount of those overrides and keep in  mind the other players can use their  overrides to override your override  [Music]  is it worth sitting down and talking  wait what kiss i feel like we're not  getting like sit and talk  but where is the  get out of my  leave right there there's the one i want  no because they're supposed to be  no  so sometimes maybe it's not the best  thing to fight for your actual one  because you'll end up getting to a  situation where you can't override  theirs later because you spent all of  yours overriding yours at the beginning  and i had that happen to me a couple  times where i would want to override the  people i'm playing it with but it's not  necessarily the best interest in me  because i need some of those overrides  for later on in the chapter and i  honestly do feel like that is one of the  biggest perspectives of as dust falls  that makes it unique compared to games  like the walking dead and life is  strange there's a few other ones but  those are the biggest ones to me and i  do think that that's one of the key  aspects that make this game fun like i  said i didn't play the broadcast mode  but the way it was described i feel like  that's going to really resonate with a  lot of especially twitch streamers it  did look like it was only twitch  streamers youtube needs to get on that  they need to make 